	('47fe43be-6ac0-4962-833d-90b00746e844', 'e05174dd-0b54-4fa9-a0dc-9e9828737fba', 2026, 'https://www.meil.in', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:29.296945+00'),
	('d90dbdef-b4d8-4594-8d75-bac85cd2cfbf', 'a7be7d61-70d5-49be-be55-56a0a2de1ef5', 2026, 'Not applicable. The company''s shares are not listed on a recognised stock exchange (Form MGT-7, FY 2022-23). It is a public company limited by shares, Indian non-government.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:30.061978+00'),
	('357abd73-b3db-44b5-8a14-baf7e54d7c99', '1c9878ac-a6f6-49f6-8699-e1d4eeff721f', 2026, 'Rs 156.01 crore: 15,60,10,000 equity shares of Rs 10 each, fully paid up (Form MGT-7, FY 2022-23, the latest annual return read).', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:30.79732+00'),
	('fb5ed64a-e874-4228-8a94-2b1b85328bea', 'a52483f8-7a21-4415-9380-34d0e630180a', 2026, 'From the principal business activities in Form MGT-7 for FY 2022-23 (share of turnover): Construction - roads, railways and utility projects 95.95%; Manufacture of gas and distribution of gaseous fuels 1.97%; Construction - buildings 1.63%; Manufacturing - plastic, non-metallic mineral, rubber and fabricated metal products 0.31%; Electric power generation, transmission and distribution 0.14%.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:31.542042+00'),
	('49967256-1d8e-4f74-93ed-37ded087f9e3', '1763bc79-ac1d-4edb-964b-307ac52ed85a', 2026, 'Engineering, procurement and construction of infrastructure and its operation and maintenance, in these business units (meil.in/business-units): Irrigation, Power, Drinking Water, Transportation, Renewable Energy, Hydrocarbons, Heavy Engineering, Manufacturing, Buildings and Industrial Infrastructure, Strategic Communications. NIC codes and the share of turnover per product are not published on the website.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:32.322065+00'),
	('e401537d-62e1-48eb-8132-4daaae198ddc', 'b0d87b40-d83b-4208-b70f-cf7a70ac547f', 2026, 'Offices listed at meil.in/contact: Hyderabad (head office), New Delhi, Vijayawada, Patna, Ahmedabad and Bhubaneswar. The number of plants and project sites is not published on the website.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:33.071895+00'),
	('62e70dc2-c8d1-4723-9225-9c5d7b93cf03', '21e6a7b7-34b2-4d8a-a778-087608aade0e', 2026, 'a. The group states a presence in more than 20 countries (meil.in/about-meil). b. The contribution of exports to turnover is not published. c. Not published.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:33.841903+00'),
	('4874591e-bf80-4874-b793-69edd4febae9', '2088d803-1829-4bab-bb94-ddf73aafac0b', 2026, 'Group companies named at meil.in: Olectra Greentech Limited, Evey Trans Private Limited, Megha Gas, ICOMM Tele Limited and Drillmec S.p.A. (Italy). The annual return for FY 2022-23 lists 97 holding, subsidiary, associate and joint venture companies, among them MEIL Holdings Limited (100%), MEIL Pura Limited (100%), TP Power Holdings Private Limited (100%) and MEIL International F.Z.E. (100%).', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:34.596904+00'),
	('1b1b27f8-dbbb-43b0-b0e1-c1e8a736fb92', '5b9a7f69-46fd-4894-8844-1e04f3e7520e', 2026, 'c. Policies published at https://www.meil.in/corporate-policies: MEIL Code of Conduct (https://meil.in/MEIL-Code-of-Conduct), MEIL Anti-Corruption Policy (https://meil.in/MEIL-Anti-Corruption-Policy), MEIL Whistle Blower Policy (https://meil.in/MEIL-Whistle-Blower-Policy), MEIL Equal Opportunity Policy (https://meil.in/Meil-equal-opportunity-policy), Supplier Code of Conduct (https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct), Customer Grievance Redressal Policy (https://meil.in/Customer-Grievance-Redressal-Policy). a and b (coverage of each principle, Board approval): to be confirmed by the company.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:35.377162+00'),
	('59387592-ab8e-478e-bb82-f42627d4dae6', 'dea62e93-5fe8-48f5-a446-4d994bed69f7', 2026, 'A Supplier Code of Conduct is published for value chain partners: https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:36.136944+00'),
	('713a37f8-927c-4140-8a0e-e2abaec5aa54', '1e31c6fe-1514-42ce-b26c-ec8131147295', 2026, 'Yes. The MEIL Anti-Corruption Policy is published at https://meil.in/MEIL-Anti-Corruption-Policy. A Whistle Blower Policy is published at https://meil.in/MEIL-Whistle-Blower-Policy.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:36.871961+00'),
	('34fa3916-3a7f-42f7-b449-dd8f0e149990', '4233626b-685c-468d-a014-f8584d7494e9', 2026, 'Yes, the MEIL Equal Opportunity Policy: https://meil.in/Meil-equal-opportunity-policy.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:37.616844+00'),
	('3ac6ee80-ec69-4ab8-8270-dd8fcd1cc0f5', '32333cb9-915b-4a5a-ab7e-8c929f9fe76c', 2026, 'The company describes a ''zero harm'' philosophy for health, safety and environment and a safety management system aligned with international best practices (meil.in/about-meil). Site-level measures are to be added by the company.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:38.356966+00'),
	('a075c649-3c82-4e74-ab0f-534bb368fe10', '53f59c59-288d-4301-a29e-8bd0b5225705', 2026, 'Latest published figures are for FY 2022-23 (Institute of Public Enterprise, ''Evaluation and Impact Assessment Study of MEIL CSR Projects for the FY 2022-23'', executive summary at meil.in/documents-and-disclosures). The company invested Rs 65.55 crore in CSR that year, in education, childcare, community health, rural infrastructure and daily sustenance. Examples: Project Disha, eye care with Shri Harihar Maharaj Charitable Trust (Rs 500 lakh): 50 eye camps in five districts of Gujarat, about 16,000 people screened, 2,000 surgeries and 6,000 free eyeglasses over 2022-23 and 2023-24. Cancer treatment at the National Cancer Institute with Dr Aabaji Thatte Seva Aur Anusandhan Sanstha (Rs 1,000 lakh): about 22,000 patients treated in 2022-23.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:39.12215+00'),
	('1293ec90-c4c1-4b13-9920-023ae014f309', 'c6ad636b-4ea1-4d76-9b13-9d40a12cbe28', 2026, 'A Customer Grievance Redressal Policy is published at https://meil.in/Customer-Grievance-Redressal-Policy. General contact: redacted@example.invalid, +91-40-44336700.', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:39.881976+00'),
	('66bcc6ee-0ccd-4c10-afd3-96ca0c7854f8', '1f973333-cba2-46e5-b890-f32b98a5fe4e', 2026, 'https://www.meil.in (business units: https://www.meil.in/business-units; landmark projects: https://www.meil.in/landmark-projects).', '2901234e-2483-4b9b-bc76-e3d75efe95ca', '2026-10-11 03:19:40.637054+00');
