metallic mineral, rubber and fabricated metal products 0.31%; Electric power generation, transmission and distribution 0.14%.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details of business activities (accounting for 90% of the turnover).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1763bc79-ac1d-4edb-964b-307ac52ed85a", "code": "A-17", "kind": "statement", "part": "II. Products / services", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Engineering, procurement and construction of infrastructure and its operation and maintenance, in these business units (meil.in/business-units): Irrigation, Power, Drinking Water, Transportation, Renewable Energy, Hydrocarbons, Heavy Engineering, Manufacturing, Buildings and Industrial Infrastructure, Strategic Communications. NIC codes and the share of turnover per product are not published on the website.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Products/Services sold by the entity (accounting for 90% of the entity''s turnover).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "b0d87b40-d83b-4208-b70f-cf7a70ac547f", "code": "A-18", "kind": "statement", "part": "III. Operations", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Offices listed at meil.in/contact: Hyderabad (head office), New Delhi, Vijayawada, Patna, Ahmedabad and Bhubaneswar. The number of plants and project sites is not published on the website.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Number of locations where plants and/or operations/offices of the entity are situated.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "21e6a7b7-34b2-4d8a-a778-087608aade0e", "code": "A-19", "kind": "statement", "part": "III. Operations", "sdgs": [], "answer": "a. The group states a presence in more than 20 countries (meil.in/about-meil). b. The contribution of exports to turnover is not published. c. Not published.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Markets served by the entity: a. Number of locations. b. What is the contribution of exports as a perce