ed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Not applicable. The company''s shares are not listed on a recognised stock exchange (Form MGT-7, FY 2022-23). It is a public company limited by shares, Indian non-government.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name of the Stock Exchange(s) where shares are listed.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1c9878ac-a6f6-49f6-8699-e1d4eeff721f", "code": "A-11", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Rs 156.01 crore: 15,60,10,000 equity shares of Rs 10 each, fully paid up (Form MGT-7, FY 2022-23, the latest annual return read).", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Paid-up Capital.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "02b1b7d6-8b89-4bb0-b4f8-235a0c9eb247", "code": "A-12", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name and contact details (telephone, email address) of the person who may be contacted in case of any queries on the BRSR report.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "14787c92-4bc3-482a-952f-8249eb0ac79d", "code": "A-13", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Reporting boundary - Are the disclosures under this report made on a standalone basis (i.e. only for the entity) or on a consolidated basis (i.e. for the entity and all the entities which form a part of its consolidated financial statements, taken together).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "8a439f95-a41e-42e7-9cf2-9045290a2e6c", "code": "A-14", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name of assessment or assurance provider.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "ca3dc850-f385-407c-81bc-a4e0377d4fb8", "code": "A-15", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Type of assessment or assurance obtained.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "a52483f8-7a21-4415-9380-34d0e630180a", "code": "A-16", "kind": "statement", "part": "II. Products / services", "sdgs": [], "answer": "From the principal business activities in Form MGT-7 for FY 2022-23 (share of turnover): Construction - roads, railways and utility projects 95.95%; Manufacture of gas and distribution of gaseous fuels 1.97%; Construction - buildings 1.63%; Manufacturing - plastic, non-metallic mineral, rubber and fabricated metal products 0.31%; Electric power generation, transmission and distribution 0.14%.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details of business activities (accounting for 90% of the turnover).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1763bc79-ac1d-4edb-964b-307ac52ed85a", "code": "A-17", "kind": "statement", "part": "II. Products / services", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Engineering, procurement and construction of infrastructure and its operation and maintenance, in these business units (meil.in/business-units): Irrigation, Power, Drinking Water, Transportation, Renewable Energy, Hydrocarbons, Heavy Engineering, Manufacturing, Buildings and Industrial Infrastructure, Strategic Communications. NIC codes and the share of turnover per product are not published on the website.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Products/Services sold by the entity (accounting for 90% of the entity''s turnover).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "b0d87b40-d83b-4208-b70f-cf7a70ac547f", "code": "A-18", "kind": "statement", "part": "III. Operations", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Offices listed at meil.in/contact: Hyderabad (head office), New Delhi, Vijayawada, Patna, Ahmedabad and Bhubaneswar. The number of plants and project sites is not published on the website.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Number of locations where plants and/or operations/offices of the entity are situated.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "21e6a7b7-34b2-4d8a-a778-087608aade0e", "code": "A-19", "kind": "statement", "part": "III. Operations", "sdgs": [], "answer": "a. The group states a presence in more than 20 countries (meil.in/about-meil). b. The contribution of exports to turnover is not published. c. Not published.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Markets served by the entity: a. Number of locations. b. What is the contribution of exports as a percentage of the total turnover of the entity? c. A brief on types of customers.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "7b7ec2c1-fdd9-4911-b67a-6362130c7406", "code": "A-20", "kind": "data", "part": "IV. Employees", "sdgs": [5, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Employees by gender", "basis": {"part": 58, "whole": 252, "partLabel": "Women", "wholeLabel": "Total employees"}, "notes": "Total, male and female counts come from the verified headcount statement.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "%", "value": 23.015873015873016}], "records": [{"unit": "%", "value": 23.015873015873, "fileName": "030 WORKFORCE_GENDER.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "c576945a-414b-4a0d-8e7c-8d0b9a215c6a", "documentId": "ee7b6b01-fba3-4da1-9568-6e5a6730baff", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "7b292ec5-867c-4029-b17f-4d2bf2d56fd9"}], "metricId": "b79dbce9-2d9a-4fa0-921f-10044d211adc", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details as at the end of Financial Year: a. Employees and workers (including differently abled). b. Differently abled Employees and workers.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "a4f68ae2-fe80-4267-b3a8-febc637fafb0", "code": "A-21", "kind": "statement", "part": "IV. Employees", "sdgs": [5], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Participation/Inclusion/Representation of women.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "cc39051a-8e64-4b6f-9c36-4ba1c581f722", "code": "A-22", "kind": "statement", "part": "IV. Employees", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Turnover rate for permanent employees and workers.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "2088d803-1829-4bab-bb94-ddf73aafac0b", "code": "A-23", "kind": "statement", "part": "V. Holding, subsidiary and associate companies (including joint ventures)", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Group companies named at meil.in: Olectra Greentech Limited, Evey Trans Private Limited, Megha Gas, ICOMM Tele Limited and Drillmec S.p.A. (Italy). The annual return for FY 2022-23 lists 97 holding, subsidiary, associate and joint venture companies, among them MEIL Holdings Limited (100%), MEIL Pura Limited (100%), TP Power Holdings Private Limited (100%) and MEIL International F.Z.E. (100%).", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Names of holding / subsidiary / associate companies / joint ventures.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "df51ea80-f7da-40fd-8f0c-c25ce4da3c0c", "code": "A-24", "kind": "data", "part": "VI. CSR details", "sdgs": [11], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "CSR expenditure", "basis": null, "notes": "BRSR asks whether CSR applies, with turnover and net worth; the spend is supporting context, not a BRSR field.", "method": "recorded", "figures": [], "records": [], "metricId": "88d6581d-2d05-4dfe-9858-a6a8a9622489", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "CSR Details: (i) Whether CSR is applicable as per section 135 of Companies Act, 2013 (Yes/No). (ii) Turnover. (iii) Net worth.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "d3fd6fb9-8531-4915-9daa-d9654c6161b1", "code": "A-25", "kind": "statement", "part": "VII. Transparency and disclosures compliances", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null,