 business activities in Form MGT-7 for FY 2022-23 (share of turnover): Construction - roads, railways and utility projects 95.95%; Manufacture of gas and distribution of gaseous fuels 1.97%; Construction - buildings 1.63%; Manufacturing - plastic, non-metallic mineral, rubber and fabricated metal products 0.31%; Electric power generation, transmission and distribution 0.14%.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details of business activities (accounting for 90% of the turnover).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1763bc79-ac1d-4edb-964b-307ac52ed85a", "code": "A-17", "kind": "statement", "part": "II. Products / services", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Engineering, procurement and construction of infrastructure and its operation and maintenance, in these business units (meil.in/business-units): Irrigation, Power, Drinking Water, Transportation, Renewable Energy, Hydrocarbons, Heavy Engineering, Manufacturing, Buildings and Industrial Infrastructure, Strategic Communications. NIC codes and the share of turnover per product are not published on the website.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Products/Services sold by the entity (accounting for 90% of the entity''s turnover).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "b0d87b40-d83b-4208-b70f-cf7a70ac547f", "code": "A-18", "kind": "statement", "part": "III. Operations", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Offices listed at meil.in/contact: Hyderabad (head office), New Delhi, Vijayawada, Patna, Ahmedabad and Bhubaneswar. The number of plants and project sites is not published on the website.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Number of locations where plants and/or operations/offices of the entity are situated.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "21e6a7b7-34b2-4d8a-a778-087608aade0e", "code": "A-19", "kind": "statement", "part": "III. Operations", "sdgs": [], "answer": "a. The group states a presence in more than 20 countries (meil.in/about-meil). b. The contribution of exports to turnover is not published. c. Not published.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Markets served by the entity: a. Number of locations. b. What is the contribution of exports as a percentage of the total turnover of the entity? c. A brief on types of customers.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "7b7ec2c1-fdd9-4911-b67a-6362130c7406", "code": "A-20", "kind": "data", "part": "IV. Employees", "sdgs": [5, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Employees by gender", "basis": {"part": 132, "whole": 576, "partLabel": "Women", "wholeLabel": "Total employees"}, "notes": "Total, male and female counts come from the verified headcount statement.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "%", "value": 22.916666666666664}], "records": [{"unit": "%", "value": 23.015873015873, "fileName": "030 WORKFORCE_GENDER.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "c576945a-414b-4a0d-8e7c-8d0b9a215c6a", "documentId": "ee7b6b01-fba3-4da1-9568-6e5a6730baff", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "7b292ec5-867c-4029-b17f-4d2bf2d56fd9"}, {"unit": "%", "value": 22.9166666666667, "fileName": "007 WORKFORCE_GENDER.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "a9b49023-b501-4c4b-a6d4-ed743c09f8b3", "documentId": "8892ee55-bc2b-4912-94f6-5c108161c72d", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "08800931-88b8-4c6c-b4df-fbfd85870003"}, {"unit": "%", "value": 22.7777777777778, "fileName": "051 WORKFORCE_GENDER.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "41cc03ef-1571-41ab-bfe6-706149edb8b1", "documentId": "e0c53e9e-5b96-4a79-b49c-02818f1ab555", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": "7e0ad851-c841-4c85-b0c5-8ced4fe7c1e4"}], "metricId": "b79dbce9-2d9a-4fa0-921f-10044d211adc", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details as at the end of Financial Year: a. Employees and workers (including differently abled). b. Differently abled Employees and workers.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "a4f68ae2-fe80-4267-b3a8-febc637fafb0", "code": "A-21", "kind": "statement", "part": "IV. Employees", "sdgs": [5], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Participation/Inclusion/Representation of women.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "cc39051a-8e64-4b6f-9c36-4ba1c581f722", "code": "A-22", "kind": "statement", "part": "IV. Employees", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Turnover rate for permanent employees and workers.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "2088d803-1829-4bab-bb94-ddf73aafac0b", "code": "A-23", "kind": "statement", "part": "V. Holding, subsidiary and associate companies (including joint ventures)", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Group companies named at meil.in: Olectra Greentech Limited, Evey Trans Private Limited, Megha Gas, ICOMM Tele Limited and Drillmec S.p.A. (Italy). The annual return for FY 2022-23 lists 97 holding, subsidiary, associate and joint venture companies, among them MEIL Holdings Limited (100%), MEIL Pura Limited (100%), TP Power Holdings Private Limited (100%) and MEIL International F.Z.E. (100%).", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Names of holding / subsidiary / associate companies / joint ventures.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "df51ea80-f7da-40fd-8f0c-c25ce4da3c0c", "code": "A-24", "kind": "data", "part": "VI. CSR details", "sdgs": [11], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "CSR expenditure", "basis": null, "notes": "BRSR asks whether CSR applies, with turnover and net worth; the spend is supporting context, not a BRSR field.", "method": "recorded", "figures": [{"unit": "INR", "value": 500000}], "records": [{"unit": "INR", "value": 500000, "fileName": "062 CSR_EXPENDITURE.jpg", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "recordId": "4fdd2d62-6373-4391-81ab-556701b2f69f", "documentId": "c19d67a0-4c20-405a-b7af-e11b4ddcbf21", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": null}], "metricId": "88d6581d-2d05-4dfe-9858-a6a8a9622489", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "CSR Details: (i) Whether CSR is applicable as per section 135 of Companies Act, 2013 (Yes/No). (ii) Turnover. (iii) Net worth.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "d3fd6fb9-8531-4915-9daa-d9654c6161b1", "code": "A-25", "kind": "statement", "part": "VII. Transparency and disclosures compliances", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Complaints/Grievances on any of the principles (Principles 1 to 9) under the National Guidelines on Responsible Business Conduct.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "81fb104d-1f54-4e93-906b-28919889a866", "code": "A-26", "kind": "statement", "part": "VII. Transparency and disclosures compliances", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Overview of the entity''s material responsible business conduct issues. Please indicate material responsible business conduct and sustainability issues pertaining to environmental and social matters that present a risk or an opportunity to your business, rationale for identifying the same, approach to adapt or mitigate the risk along-with its financial implications.", "indicatorType": null}]}, {"code": "B", "name": "Management and Process Disclosures", "indicators": [{"id": "5b9a7f69-46fd-4894-8844-1e04f3e7520e", "code": "B-1", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": "c. Policies published at https://www.meil.in/corporate-policies: MEIL Code of Conduct (https://meil.in/MEIL-Code-of-Conduct), MEIL Anti-Corruption Policy (https://meil.in/MEIL-Anti-Corruption-Policy), MEIL Whistle Blower Policy (https://meil.in/MEIL-Whistle-Blower-Policy), MEIL Equal Opportunity Policy (https://meil.in/Meil-equal-opportunity-policy), Supplier Code of Conduct (https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct), Customer Grievance Redressal Policy (https://meil.in/Customer-Grievance-Redressal-Policy). a and b (coverage of each principle, Board approval): to be confirmed by the company.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "a. Whether your entity''s policy/policies cover each principle and its core elements of the NGRBCs. (Yes/No) b. Has the policy been approved by the Board? (Yes/No) c. Web Link of the Policies, if available.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "63f1434a-22ff-4928-b90c-f45cac03a53f", "code": "B-2", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Whether the entity has translated the policy into procedures. (Yes / No)", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "dea62e93-5fe8-48f5-a446-4d994bed69f7", "code": "B-3", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": "A Supplier Code of Conduct is published for value chain partners: https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Do the enlisted policies extend to your value chain partners? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1b5980e5-010e-4e4b-ad17-5784bd14ef3a", "code": "B-4", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name of the national and international codes/certifications/labels/ standards (e.g. Forest Stewardship Council, Fairtrade, Rainforest Alliance, Trustea) standards (e.g. SA 8000, OHSAS, ISO, BIS) adopted by your entity and mapped to each principle.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "c7f40ede-5dda-4caf-a6ff-49a7d5659dd2", "code": "B-5", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Specific commitments, goals and targets set by the entity with defined timelines, if any.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "bf5903da-9358-4f4e-ae62-4d3c840714ea", "code": "B-6", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Performance of the entity against the specific commitments, goals and targets along-with reasons in case the same are not met.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "0390f9e7-7f1c-452b-9b0d-bb965898d5b9", "code": "B-7", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Statement by director responsible for the business responsibility report, highlighting ESG related challenges, targets and achievements.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "d5eb0bfd-61d4-408a-947e-9121b00b2dd0", "code": "B-8", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details of the highest authority responsible for implementation and oversight of the Business Responsibility policy (ies).", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "a4325a86-e978-44f6-a9cd-6595270f2c7e", "code": "B-9", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Does the entity have a specified Committee of the Board/ Director responsible for decision making on sustainability related issues? (Yes / No). If yes, provide details.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "d624603c-9e34-4587-961b-0825a87cb158", "code": "B-10", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Details of Review of NGRBCs by the Company.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "4640733d-3ef0-4e15-a524-dda76da43847", "code": "B-11", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Has the entity carried out independent assessment/ evaluation of the working of its policies by an external agency? (Yes/No). If yes, provide name of the agency.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "725def61-23b7-4ad0-99ae-93f9f61861b4", "code": "B-12", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "If answer to question (1) above is \"No\" i.e. not all Principles are covered by a policy, reasons to be stated.", "indicatorType": null}]}, {"code": "C", "name": "Principle Wise Performance Disclosure", "indicators": [{"id": "9bc9b666-b5c4-4331-bcb3-fd93208ac28a", "code": "P1-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Percentage coverage by training and awareness programmes on any of the Principles during the financial year.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "7cf35c30-2ef5-4348-8e83-b491d044baa8", "code": "P1-E2", "kind": "data", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Fines and penalties", "basis": null, "notes": "Monetary fines and penalties paid.", "method": "recorded", "figures": [{"unit": "INR", "value": 25000}], "records": [{"unit": "INR", "value": 25000, "fileName": "multi-bill (2 bills) (page 2).pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "bae22890-3e5a-4e58-a0f3-00a384ef494a", "documentId": "fadab325-25b2-43fb-a9de-b1f3fbd14395", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": null}], "metricId": "2bea0bc6-ef41-41a9-86ec-92206b050beb", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Details of fines / penalties /punishment/ award/ compounding fees/ settlement amount paid in proceedings (by the entity or by directors / KMPs) with regulators/ law enforcement agencies/ judicial institutions, in the financial year.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "59c83cc7-52f8-4f7f-b872-8ea45329673b", "code": "P1-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Of the instances disclosed in Question 2 above, details of the Appeal/ Revision preferred in cases where monetary or non-monetary action has been appealed.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "1e31c6fe-1514-42ce-b26c-ec8131147295", "code": "P1-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": "Yes. The MEIL Anti-Corruption Policy is published at https://meil.in/MEIL-Anti-Corruption-Policy. A Whistle Blower Policy is published at https://meil.in/MEIL-Whistle-Blower-Policy.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Does the entity have an anti-corruption or anti-bribery policy? If yes, provide details in brief and if available, provide a web-link to the policy.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "0f8147a1-3bc3-41a1-b378-01ff21afc981", "code": "P1-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Number of Directors/KMPs/employees/workers against whom disciplinary action was taken by any law enforcement agency for the charges of bribery/ corruption.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "033e84b3-9361-406f-9e8f-6df4b02aef05", "code": "P1-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Details of complaints with regard to conflict of interest.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "a8b80e90-b7dd-44ef-b22c-7eb65ea204a5", "code": "P1-E7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective action taken or underway on issues related to fines / penalties / action taken by regulators/ law enforcement agencies/ judicial institutions, on cases of corruption and conflicts of interest.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "a17b1cc0-14b7-438a-9356-95f5cb92129b", "code": "P1-E8", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Number of days of accounts payables ((Accounts payable *365) / Cost of goods/services procured).", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ef7d1636-197c-4194-811d-8ab30cb9c06a", "code": "P1-E9", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Open-ness of business: Provide details of concentration of purchases and sales with trading houses, dealers and related parties along-with loans and advances & investments, with related parties.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "37c34e91-d356-452e-b8aa-7b546778fdfc", "code": "P1-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Awareness programmes conducted for value chain partners on any of the Principles during the financial year.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7747ad23-6649-478c-a8eb-0419a062d87b", "code": "P1-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Does the entity have processes in place to avoid/ manage conflict of interests involving members of the Board? (Yes/No). If Yes, provide details of the same.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "891c6957-aae2-48ff-8a07-c7abee580dfa", "code": "P2-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [9], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Percentage of R&D and capital expenditure (capex) investments in specific technologies to improve the environmental and social impacts of product and processes to total R&D and capex investments made by the entity, respectively.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "9bb6e3e1-d393-4fb5-bf95-3760337e2d1a", "code": "P2-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [12], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "a. Does the entity have procedures in place for sustainable sourcing? (Yes/No) b. If yes, what percentage of inputs were sourced sustainably?", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "28585ce9-7c8a-4acd-aa4a-85a94791fada", "code": "P2-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [12], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Describe the processes in place to safely reclaim your products for reusing, recycling and disposing at the end of life, for (a) Plastics (including packaging) (b) E-waste (c) Hazardous waste and (d) other waste.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "4a3dc69d-cb0f-41eb-9f70-3575d152956b", "code": "P2-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Whether Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) is applicable to the entity''s activities (Yes / No). If yes, whether the waste collection plan is in line with the Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) plan submitted to Pollution Control Boards?", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "393d7190-19a7-4663-9937-ef708fd2fcea", "code": "P2-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Has the entity conducted Life Cycle Perspective / Assessments (LCA) for any of its products (for manufacturing industry) or for its services (for service industry)? If yes, provide details.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "b5f8b5dc-7f63-4eb4-a5bc-66faf3b8cd6e", "code": "P2-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "If there are any significant social or environmental concerns and/or risks arising from production or disposal of your products / services, as identified in the Life Cycle Perspective / Assessments (LCA) or through any other means, briefly describe the same along-with action taken to mitigate the same.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "291bdc0f-9cf8-40c7-b904-78a5b6203527", "code": "P2-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [12], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Percentage of recycled or reused input material to total material (by value) used in production (for manufacturing industry) or providing services (for service industry).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "6fbf23a5-d43c-4f1f-a829-60ad0bd29333", "code": "P2-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Of the products and packaging reclaimed at end of life of products, amount (in metric tonnes) reused, recycled and safely disposed.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1b5b40a9-e7c5-419a-8fdc-fff4e5c55fa3", "code": "P2-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Reclaimed products and their packaging materials (as percentage of products sold) for each product category.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7b7dfef7-d057-4b29-807d-a4d5cc990933", "code": "P3-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [3, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "a. Details of measures for the well-being of employees. b. Details of measures for the well-being of workers. c. Spending on measures towards well-being of employees and workers (including permanent and other than permanent).", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "c487f07b-9638-4a19-adf6-25faa00c02a2", "code": "P3-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of retirement benefits, for Current Financial Year and Previous Financial Year.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "08522ecc-5c74-4096-96ea-f63dc1c167b5", "code": "P3-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Accessibility of workplaces: Are the premises / offices of the entity accessible to differently abled employees and workers, as per the requirements of the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, 2016? If not, whether any steps are being taken by the entity in this regard.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "4233626b-685c-468d-a014-f8584d7494e9", "code": "P3-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [10], "answer": "Yes, the MEIL Equal Opportunity Policy: https://meil.in/Meil-equal-opportunity-policy.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity have an equal opportunity policy as per the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, 2016? If so, provide a web-link to the policy.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ea7a91b4-817f-4dc3-9507-6521e6f1d4ce", "code": "P3-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Return to work and Retention rates of permanent employees and workers that took parental leave.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ed5922c5-9f1e-4826-ab94-c522b9d5b422", "code": "P3-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Is there a mechanism available to receive and redress grievances for the following categories of employees and worker? If yes, give details of the mechanism in brief.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "adf868fb-1d5f-48a3-82ed-dc4b92e22a04", "code": "P3-E7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Membership of employees and worker in association(s) or Unions recognised by the listed entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "4dd251e2-fa80-49bc-b010-a1f7d61af5ea", "code": "P3-E8", "kind": "data", "part": null, "sdgs": [4, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Employees trained", "basis": {"part": 473, "whole": 576, "partLabel": "Employees trained", "wholeLabel": "Total employees"}, "notes": "Employees trained against total employees.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "%", "value": 82.11805555555556}], "records": [{"unit": "%", "value": 82.1428571428571, "fileName": "031 WORKFORCE_TRAINING.jpg", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "recordId": "0f4d6a8e-af89-4e1b-8796-442a96aa03fa", "documentId": "f4b882f6-0a31-4cac-aa0c-faf9c85dd441", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "b3a7e124-aa9e-42a2-85b2-b107a26e39d1"}, {"unit": "%", "value": 81.9444444444444, "fileName": "008 WORKFORCE_TRAINING.jpg", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "recordId": "cb78ee68-dad7-4352-83a0-439613fa85a1", "documentId": "2884ec8d-2824-494c-9cff-46d23f0da353", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "88e9e7fc-ba32-44d0-8316-533f0ecb6fa8"}, {"unit": "%", "value": 82.2222222222222, "fileName": "052 WORKFORCE_TRAINING.png", "mimeType": "image/png", "recordId": "30d424cf-52ce-4b4f-b1e8-92a6268fb5f1", "documentId": "48b5144d-6e76-4aff-b634-99c9392f120f", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": "b1690ca8-b544-485d-91e5-5dc41b4bb8be"}], "metricId": "3fa7f9f6-08d9-41c4-bb0b-336cdab61530", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of training given to employees and workers.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "caa85ef0-fac9-4d58-9159-2ca2b0cd5d65", "code": "P3-E9", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of performance and career development reviews of employees and worker.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "78cb426d-ad2d-4a5e-8de2-e438c803ef31", "code": "P3-E10", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [3], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Health and safety management system: a. Whether an occupational health and safety management system has been implemented by the entity? (Yes/ No). If yes, the coverage of such system? b. What are the processes used to identify work-related hazards and assess risks on a routine and non-routine basis by the entity? c. Whether you have processes for workers to report the work-related hazards and to remove themselves from such risks. (Y/N) d. Do the employees/ worker of the entity have access to non-occupational medical and healthcare services? (Yes/ No)", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b208e71a-e8e9-4c35-8b4c-70333292c3b2", "code": "P3-E11", "kind": "data", "part": null, "sdgs": [3, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Safety incidents — employees", "basis": {"part": 0, "whole": 115200, "partLabel": "Lost time injuries", "wholeLabel": "Person-hours worked"}, "notes": "Employees. The figure is the lost time injury frequency rate.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0}], "records": [{"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0, "fileName": "029 SAFETY_EMPLOYEES.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "45db5a77-7e1f-4c17-a23d-291c0ac76b98", "documentId": "41affe45-e5a6-41d3-822b-1f33774e671e", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "3b655eed-549c-407d-a38c-b948059628ab"}, {"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0, "fileName": "006 SAFETY_EMPLOYEES.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "9b54c53a-40c0-4590-8dbe-30a046709be3", "documentId": "7ceeb6f3-3a1f-4457-b07d-2e841e7bd9b1", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "aa7587e0-6f0c-4908-a889-42271f41b8c2"}, {"unit": "per m