929f9fe76c", "code": "P3-E12", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": "The company describes a ''zero harm'' philosophy for health, safety and environment and a safety management system aligned with international best practices (meil.in/about-meil). Site-level measures are to be added by the company.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Describe the measures taken by the entity to ensure a safe and healthy workplace.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "453abb14-614e-41ff-a2c1-58ec3eaea9ae", "code": "P3-E13", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Number of Complaints on the following made by employees and workers: working conditions; health & safety.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ee3ef3ba-6b1f-4779-b791-be5138894c76", "code": "P3-E14", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Assessments for the year: health and safety practices; working conditions.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "5030d14f-fee8-4747-9a30-14757716b768", "code": "P3-E15", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective action taken or underway to address safety-related incidents (if any) and on significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health & safety practices and working conditions.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "091c511c-9eb3-46d7-8572-b885abc37c13", "code": "P3-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity extend any life insurance or any compensatory package in the event of death of a. Employees (Y/N) b. Workers (Y/N).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1945248c-31ec-42b6-b162-8c82d4c016b8", "code": "P3-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide the measures undertaken by the entity to ensure that statutory dues have been deducted and deposited by the value chain partners.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "fc817c3a-6a6f-43de-b016-8a3916a54f37", "code": "P3-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide the number of employees / workers having suffered high consequence work-related injury / ill-health / fatalities (as reported in Q11 of Essential Indicators above), who have been rehabilitated and placed in suitable employment or whose family members have been placed in suitable employment.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "e3b19e1c-507a-477d-ba24-b3856c2c857a", "code": "P3-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity provide transition assistance programs to facilitate continued employability and the management of career endings resulting from retirement or termination of employment? (Yes/ No)", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "82ff1072-7f57-437f-b225-f8dce9f4507d", "code": "P3-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details on assessment of value chain partners: health and safety practices; working conditions.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1b182858-2b35-4ee8-9bb1-f24039a228e7", "code": "P3-L6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective actions taken or underway to address significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health and safety practices and working conditions of value chain partners.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7b0b3110-716e-4cfd-92f9-34651f4aaca0", "code": "P4-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Describe the processes for identifying key stakeholder groups of the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "87bdbdb1-bddc-46e7-aaec-8082c530e137", "code": "P4-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [17], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 4, "questionText": "List stakeholder groups identified as key for your entity and the frequency of engagement with each stakeholder group.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b0e65821-4425-44cd-b4c5-2d5e2e6a4992", "code": "P4-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Provide the processes for consultation between stakeholders and the Board on economic, environmental and social topics or if consultation is delegated, how is feedback from such consultations provided to the Board.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "02972d72-93fb-4712-8d83-056890d2d388", "code": "P4-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Whether stakeholder consultation is used to support the identification and management of environmental and social topics (Yes / No). If so, provide details of instances as to how the inputs received from stakeholders on these topics were incorporated into policies and activities of the entity.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "0213c581-4a39-42f9-8eae-f3c762be7e65", "code": "P4-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Provide details of instances of engagement with and actions taken to, address the concerns of vulnerable/ marginalized stakeholder groups.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, 