ice address.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "b5ed408d-576d-4101-bcad-9c787be19854", "code": "A-5", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "S-2, Technocrats Industrial Estate, Balanagar, Hyderabad - 500 037, Telangana, India.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Corporate address.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "7c1ec7f8-ca72-481f-aa42-6e190a035878", "code": "A-6", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "redacted@example.invalid", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "E-mail.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "46258277-6ad9-4f35-b192-2bb127c786cc", "code": "A-7", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "+91-40-44336700 / +91-40-44336800", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Telephone.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "e05174dd-0b54-4fa9-a0dc-9e9828737fba", "code": "A-8", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "https://www.meil.in", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Website.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "bfd3168a-d31b-4fdc-bfab-14a6625185ea", "code": "A-9", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Financial year for which reporting is being done.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "a7be7d61-70d5-49be-be55-56a0a2de1ef5", "code": "A-10", "kind": "statement", "part": "I. Details of the listed entity", "sdgs": [], "answer": "Not applicable. The company''s shares are not listed on a recognised stock exchange (Form MGT-7, FY 2022-23). It is a public company limited by shares, Indian non-government.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name of the Stock Exchange(s) where shares are listed.", "indicatorTyp