in proceedings (by the entity or by directors / KMPs) with regulators/ law enforcement agencies/ judicial institutions, in the financial year.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "59c83cc7-52f8-4f7f-b872-8ea45329673b", "code": "P1-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Of the instances disclosed in Question 2 above, details of the Appeal/ Revision preferred in cases where monetary or non-monetary action has been appealed.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "1e31c6fe-1514-42ce-b26c-ec8131147295", "code": "P1-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": "Yes. The MEIL Anti-Corruption Policy is published at https://meil.in/MEIL-Anti-Corruption-Policy. A Whistle Blower Policy is published at https://meil.in/MEIL-Whistle-Blower-Policy.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Does the entity have an anti-corruption or anti-bribery policy? If yes, provide details in brief and if available, provide a web-link to the policy.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "0f8147a1-3bc3-41a1-b378-01ff21afc981", "code": "P1-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Number of Directors/KMPs/employees/workers against whom disciplinary action was taken by any law enforcement agency for the charges of bribery/ corruption.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "033e84b3-9361-406f-9e8f-6df4b02aef05", "code": "P1-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Details of complaints with regard to conflict of interest.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "a8b80e90-b7dd-44ef-b22c-7eb65ea204a5", "code": "P1-E7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective action taken or underway on issues related to fines / penalties / action taken by regulators/ law enforcement agencies/ judicial institutions, on cases of corruption and conflicts of interest.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "a17b1cc0-14b7-438a-9356-95f5cb92129b", "code": "P1-E8", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Number of days of accounts payables ((Accounts payable *365) / Cost of goods/services procured).", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ef7d1636-197c-4194-811d-8ab30cb9c06a", "code": "P1-E9", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Open-ness of business: Provide details of concentration of purchases and sales with trading houses, dealers and related parties along-with loans and advances & investments, with related parties.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "37c34e91-d356-452e-b8aa-7b546778fdfc", "code": "P1-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Awareness programmes conducted for value chain partners on any of the Principles during the financial year.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7747ad23-6649-478c-a8eb-0419a062d87b", "code": "P1-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 1, "questionText": "Does the entity have processes in place to avoid/ manage conflict of interests involving members of the Board? (Yes/No). If Yes, provide details of the same.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "891c6957-aae2-48ff-8a07-c7abee580dfa", "code": "P2-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [9], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Percentage of R&D and capital expenditure (capex) investments in specific technologies to improve the environmental and social impacts of product and processes to total R&D and capex investments made by the entity, respectively.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "9bb6e3e1-d393-4fb5-bf95-3760337e2d1a", "code": "P2-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [12], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "a. Does the entity have procedures in place for sustainable sourcing? (Yes/No) b. If yes, what percentage of inputs were sourced sustainably?", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "28585ce9-7c8a-4acd-aa4a-85a94791fada", "code": "P2-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [12], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Describe the processes in place to safely reclaim your products for reusing, recycling and disposing at the end of life, for (a) Plastics (including packaging) (b) E-waste (c) Hazardous waste and (d) other waste.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "4a3dc69d-cb0f-41eb-9f70-3575d152956b", "code": "P2-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Whether Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) is applicable to the entity''s activities (Yes / No). If yes, whether the waste collection plan is in line with the Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) plan submitted to Pollution Control Boards?", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "393d7190-19a7-4663-9937-ef708fd2fcea", "code": "P2-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Has the entity conducted Life Cycle Perspective / Assessments (LCA) for any of its products (for manufacturing industry) or for its services (for service industry)? If yes, provide details.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "b5f8b5dc-7f63-4eb4-a5bc-66faf3b8cd6e", "code": "P2-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "If there are any significant social or environmental concerns and/or risks arising from production or disposal of your products / services, as identified in the Life Cycle Perspective / Assessments (LCA) or through any other means, briefly describe the same along-with action taken to mitigate the same.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "291bdc0f-9cf8-40c7-b904-78a5b6203527", "code": "P2-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [12], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Percentage of recycled or reused input material to total material (by value) used in production (for manufacturing industry) or providing services (for service industry).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "6fbf23a5-d43c-4f1f-a829-60ad0bd29333", "code": "P2-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Of the products and packaging reclaimed at end of life of products, amount (in metric tonnes) reused, recycled and safely disposed.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1b5b40a9-e7c5-419a-8fdc-fff4e5c55fa3", "code": "P2-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 2, "questionText": "Reclaimed products and their packaging materials (as percentage of products sold) for each product category.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7b7dfef7-d057-4b29-807d-a4d5cc990933", "code": "P3-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [3, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "a. Details of measures for the well-being of employees. b. Details of measures for the well-being of workers. c. Spending on measures towards well-being of employees and workers (including permanent and other than permanent).", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "c487f07b-9638-4a19-adf6-25faa00c02a2", "code": "P3-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of retirement benefits, for Current Financial Year and Previous Financial Year.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "08522ecc-5c74-4096-96ea-f63dc1c167b5", "code": "P3-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Accessibility of workplaces: Are the premises / offices of the entity accessible to differently abled employees and workers, as per the requirements of the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, 2016? If not, whether any steps are being taken by the entity in this regard.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "4233626b-685c-468d-a014-f8584d7494e9", "code": "P3-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [10], "answer": "Yes, the MEIL Equal Opportunity Policy: https://meil.in/Meil-equal-opportunity-policy.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity have an equal opportunity policy as per the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, 2016? If so, provide a web-link to the policy.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ea7a91b4-817f-4dc3-9507-6521e6f1d4ce", "code": "P3-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Return to work and Retention rates of permanent employees and workers that took parental leave.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ed5922c5-9f1e-4826-ab94-c522b9d5b422", "code": "P3-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Is there a mechanism available to receive and redress grievances for the following categories of employees and worker? If yes, give details of the mechanism in brief.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "adf868fb-1d5f-48a3-82ed-dc4b92e22a04", "code": "P3-E7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Membership of employees and worker in association(s) or Unions recognised by the listed entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "4dd251e2-fa80-49bc-b010-a1f7d61af5ea", "code": "P3-E8", "kind": "data", "part": null, "sdgs": [4, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Employees trained", "basis": {"part": 473, "whole": 576, "partLabel": "Employees trained", "wholeLabel": "Total employees"}, "notes": "Employees trained against total employees.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "%", "value": 82.11805555555556}], "records": [{"unit": "%", "value": 82.1428571428571, "fileName": "031 WORKFORCE_TRAINING.jpg", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "recordId": "0f4d6a8e-af89-4e1b-8796-442a96aa03fa", "documentId": "f4b882f6-0a31-4cac-aa0c-faf9c85dd441", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "b3a7e124-aa9e-42a2-85b2-b107a26e39d1"}, {"unit": "%", "value": 81.9444444444444, "fileName": "008 WORKFORCE_TRAINING.jpg", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "recordId": "cb78ee68-dad7-4352-83a0-439613fa85a1", "documentId": "2884ec8d-2824-494c-9cff-46d23f0da353", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "88e9e7fc-ba32-44d0-8316-533f0ecb6fa8"}, {"unit": "%", "value": 82.2222222222222, "fileName": "052 WORKFORCE_TRAINING.png", "mimeType": "image/png", "recordId": "30d424cf-52ce-4b4f-b1e8-92a6268fb5f1", "documentId": "48b5144d-6e76-4aff-b634-99c9392f120f", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": "b1690ca8-b544-485d-91e5-5dc41b4bb8be"}], "metricId": "3fa7f9f6-08d9-41c4-bb0b-336cdab61530", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of training given to employees and workers.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "caa85ef0-fac9-4d58-9159-2ca2b0cd5d65", "code": "P3-E9", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of performance and career development reviews of employees and worker.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "78cb426d-ad2d-4a5e-8de2-e438c803ef31", "code": "P3-E10", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [3], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Health and safety management system: a. Whether an occupational health and safety management system has been implemented by the entity? (Yes/ No). If yes, the coverage of such system? b. What are the processes used to identify work-related hazards and assess risks on a routine and non-routine basis by the entity? c. Whether you have processes for workers to report the work-related hazards and to remove themselves from such risks. (Y/N) d. Do the employees/ worker of the entity have access to non-occupational medical and healthcare services? (Yes/ No)", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b208e71a-e8e9-4c35-8b4c-70333292c3b2", "code": "P3-E11", "kind": "data", "part": null, "sdgs": [3, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "Safety incidents — employees", "basis": {"part": 0, "whole": 115200, "partLabel": "Lost time injuries", "wholeLabel": "Person-hours worked"}, "notes": "Employees. The figure is the lost time injury frequency rate.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0}], "records": [{"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0, "fileName": "029 SAFETY_EMPLOYEES.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "45db5a77-7e1f-4c17-a23d-291c0ac76b98", "documentId": "41affe45-e5a6-41d3-822b-1f33774e671e", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "3b655eed-549c-407d-a38c-b948059628ab"}, {"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0, "fileName": "006 SAFETY_EMPLOYEES.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "9b54c53a-40c0-4590-8dbe-30a046709be3", "documentId": "7ceeb6f3-3a1f-4457-b07d-2e841e7bd9b1", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "aa7587e0-6f0c-4908-a889-42271f41b8c2"}, {"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 0, "fileName": "050 SAFETY_EMPLOYEES.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "2e6ab663-5784-4493-8818-4c6de404911d", "documentId": "e3bc28fa-c86c-4551-aa91-50c03a8d481f", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": "836d36d8-2224-45dd-bdad-e59d53b9d88c"}], "metricId": "d56a2ae3-ea9e-439c-abc9-75ce00504dc8", "reportedValue": "result"}, {"name": "Safety incidents — workers", "basis": {"part": 3, "whole": 768000, "partLabel": "Lost time injuries", "wholeLabel": "Person-hours worked"}, "notes": "Workers. The figure is the lost time injury frequency rate.", "method": "ratio", "figures": [{"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 3.90625}], "records": [{"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 2.97619047619048, "fileName": "multi-bill (3 bills) (page 1).pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "50fa362d-b11b-40b9-9a60-3dd87ef7f05f", "documentId": "e721e424-b9c1-482c-a288-1848565c5ec0", "orgUnitName": "BEST Mumbai e-buses", "calculationId": "c9c40f17-20c9-4091-99ab-94d2a46ae4d3"}, {"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 5.20833333333333, "fileName": "multi-bill (2 bills) (page 1).pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "b6b9cb4c-45b3-4b77-9f38-9c74c5e8e001", "documentId": "6c791d00-2e07-4519-8ee0-f20d27d69903", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "9a1f127b-02c6-4005-ae91-08db8fbb3639"}, {"unit": "per million person-hours", "value": 4.16666666666667, "fileName": "Safety incidents — workers.pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "c855cba3-df22-4ebb-a5d5-6f54bfa7dbbf", "documentId": "2eebefa9-0991-4871-900c-042c9ab2c475", "orgUnitName": "Seetharampur plant, Telangana", "calculationId": "082d0678-d2ab-4c94-ad2b-af78ea9b8230"}], "metricId": "7e149d31-c001-4801-b6c4-512b173b612f", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details of safety related incidents.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "32333cb9-915b-4a5a-ab7e-8c929f9fe76c", "code": "P3-E12", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": "The company describes a ''zero harm'' philosophy for health, safety and environment and a safety management system aligned with international best practices (meil.in/about-meil). Site-level measures are to be added by the company.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Describe the measures taken by the entity to ensure a safe and healthy workplace.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "453abb14-614e-41ff-a2c1-58ec3eaea9ae", "code": "P3-E13", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Number of Complaints on the following made by employees and workers: working conditions; health & safety.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ee3ef3ba-6b1f-4779-b791-be5138894c76", "code": "P3-E14", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Assessments for the year: health and safety practices; working conditions.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "5030d14f-fee8-4747-9a30-14757716b768", "code": "P3-E15", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective action taken or underway to address safety-related incidents (if any) and on significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health & safety practices and working conditions.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "091c511c-9eb3-46d7-8572-b885abc37c13", "code": "P3-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity extend any life insurance or any compensatory package in the event of death of a. Employees (Y/N) b. Workers (Y/N).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1945248c-31ec-42b6-b162-8c82d4c016b8", "code": "P3-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide the measures undertaken by the entity to ensure that statutory dues have been deducted and deposited by the value chain partners.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "fc817c3a-6a6f-43de-b016-8a3916a54f37", "code": "P3-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide the number of employees / workers having suffered high consequence work-related injury / ill-health / fatalities (as reported in Q11 of Essential Indicators above), who have been rehabilitated and placed in suitable employment or whose family members have been placed in suitable employment.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "e3b19e1c-507a-477d-ba24-b3856c2c857a", "code": "P3-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity provide transition assistance programs to facilitate continued employability and the management of career endings resulting from retirement or termination of employment? (Yes/ No)", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "82ff1072-7f57-437f-b225-f8dce9f4507d", "code": "P3-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details on assessment of value chain partners: health and safety practices; working conditions.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1b182858-2b35-4ee8-9bb1-f24039a228e7", "code": "P3-L6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective actions taken or underway to address significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health and safety practices and working conditions of value chain partners.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7b0b3110-716e-4cfd-92f9-34651f4aaca0", "code": "P4-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Describe the processes for identifying key stakeholder groups of the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "87bdbdb1-bddc-46e7-aaec-8082c530e137", "code": "P4-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [17], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 4, "questionText": "List stakeholder groups identified as key for your entity and the frequency of engagement with each stakeholder group.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b0e65821-4425-44cd-b4c5-2d5e2e6a4992", "code": "P4-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Provide the processes for consultation between stakeholders and the Board on economic, environmental and social topics or if consultation is delegated, how is feedback from such consultations provided to the Board.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "02972d72-93fb-4712-8d83-056890d2d388", "code": "P4-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Whether stakeholder consultation is used to support the identification and management of environmental and social topics (Yes / No). If so, provide details of instances as to how the inputs received from stakeholders on these topics were incorporated into policies and activities of the entity.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "0213c581-4a39-42f9-8eae-f3c762be7e65", "code": "P4-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Provide details of instances of engagement with and actions taken to, address the concerns of vulnerable/ marginalized stakeholder groups.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "da4dfd0b-8374-46dc-aaed-e242bee90bc4", "code": "P5-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Employees and workers who have been provided training on human rights issues and policy(ies) of the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "f0e2a291-3fd5-447d-a334-4d0544c28253", "code": "P5-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [1, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details of minimum wages paid to employees and workers.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b6915335-c76b-4cb8-b8fa-ff219f0451aa", "code": "P5-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [5, 10], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details of remuneration/salary/wages: a. Median remuneration / wages. b. Gross wages paid to females as % of total wages paid by the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "e3aba8c2-3a91-49ec-b98f-454f888aab0e", "code": "P5-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Do you have a focal point (Individual/ Committee) responsible for addressing human rights impacts or issues caused or contributed to by the business? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "e331d0b3-de92-4da0-8aec-2c12af43bb0c", "code": "P5-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Describe the internal mechanisms in place to redress grievances related to human rights issues.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "2a11a2c7-5826-4d69-be0e-725918f32dbc", "code": "P5-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Number of Complaints on the following made by employees and workers: s