d69f7", "code": "B-3", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": "A Supplier Code of Conduct is published for value chain partners: https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Do the enlisted policies extend to your value chain partners? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1b5980e5-010e-4e4b-ad17-5784bd14ef3a", "code": "B-4", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name of the national and international codes/certifications/labels/ standards (e.g. Forest Stewardship Council, Fairtrade, Rainforest Alliance, Trustea) standards (e.g. SA 8000, OHSAS, ISO, BIS) adopted by your entity and mapped to each principle.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "c7f40ede-5dda-4caf-a6ff-49a7d5659dd2", "code": "B-5", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Specific commitments, goals and targets set by the entity with defined timelines, if any.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "bf5903da-9358-4f4e-ae62-4d3c840714ea", "code": "B-6", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Performance of the entity against the specific commitments, goals and targets along-with reasons in case the same are not met.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "0390f9e7-7f1c-452b-9b0d-bb965898d5b9", "code": "B-7", "kind": "statement", "part": "Governance, leadership and oversight", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Statement by director responsible for the business responsibility report, highlighting ESG related challenges, targets and achievements.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "d5e