 career endings resulting from retirement or termination of employment? (Yes/ No)", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "82ff1072-7f57-437f-b225-f8dce9f4507d", "code": "P3-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Details on assessment of value chain partners: health and safety practices; working conditions.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1b182858-2b35-4ee8-9bb1-f24039a228e7", "code": "P3-L6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective actions taken or underway to address significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health and safety practices and working conditions of value chain partners.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7b0b3110-716e-4cfd-92f9-34651f4aaca0", "code": "P4-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Describe the processes for identifying key stakeholder groups of the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "87bdbdb1-bddc-46e7-aaec-8082c530e137", "code": "P4-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [17], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 4, "questionText": "List stakeholder groups identified as key for your entity and the frequency of engagement with each stakeholder group.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b0e65821-4425-44cd-b4c5-2d5e2e6a4992", "code": "P4-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Provide the processes for consultation between stakeholders and the Board on economic, environmental and social topics or if consultation is delegated, how is feedback from such consultations provided to the Board.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "02972d72-93fb-4712-8d83-056890d2d388", "code": "P4-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Whether stakeholder consultation is used to support the identification and management of environmental and social topics (Yes / No). If so, provide details of instances as to how the inputs received from stakeholders on these topics were incorporated into policies and activities of the entity.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "0213c581-4a39-42f9-8eae-f3c762be7e65", "code": "P4-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 4, "questionText": "Provide details of instances of engagement with and actions taken to, address the concerns of vulnerable/ marginalized stakeholder groups.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "da4dfd0b-8374-46dc-aaed-e242bee90bc4", "code": "P5-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Employees and workers who have been provided training on human rights issues and policy(ies) of the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "f0e2a291-3fd5-447d-a334-4d0544c28253", "code": "P5-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [1, 8], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details of minimum wages paid to employees and workers.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "b6915335-c76b-4cb8-b8fa-ff219f0451aa", "code": "P5-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [5, 10], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details of remuneration/salary/wages: a. Median remuneration / wages. b. Gross wages paid to females as % of total wages paid by the entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "e3aba8c2-3a91-49ec-b98f-454f888aab0e", "code": "P5-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Do you have a focal point (Individual/ Committee) responsible for addressing human rights impacts or issues caused or contributed to by the business? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "e331d0b3-de92-4da0-8aec-2c12af43bb0c", "code": "P5-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Describe the internal mechanisms in place to redress grievances related to human rights issues.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "2a11a2c7-5826-4d69-be0e-725918f32dbc", "code": "P5-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Number of Complaints on the following made by employees and workers: sexual harassment; discrimination at workplace; child labour; forced labour/involuntary labour; wages; other human rights related issues.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "9f842531-f81c-4a1c-8b81-2d6b60513901", "code": "P5-E7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [5], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Complaints filed under the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "8a6c9118-c539-48ec-91e9-be389999b97a", "code": "P5-E8", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Mechanisms to prevent adverse consequences to the complainant in discrimination and harassment cases.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "27aa2f1d-0b72-479e-a2f0-b0cf5c8a2320", "code": "P5-E9", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Do human rights requirements form part of your business agreements and contracts? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "e20b49b9-acfe-4