pe 3 category: upstream transportation and distribution.", "method": "sum", "figures": [{"unit": "kgCO2e", "value": 7316}], "records": [{"unit": "kgCO2e", "value": 7316, "fileName": "016 FREIGHT_IN_HDV.png", "mimeType": "image/png", "recordId": "bf6b73fe-da01-4f56-942d-b52363e19211", "documentId": "b33ff353-972c-466f-a783-42e1b9efc36b", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "cfaf460b-7cce-4981-b5f5-1c3a37825aac"}], "metricId": "b07941e7-5a77-4c98-b635-147891c035d7", "reportedValue": "result"}, {"name": "Downstream logistics — light truck (under 3.5 t)", "basis": null, "notes": "Scope 3 category: downstream transportation and distribution.", "method": "sum", "figures": [], "records": [], "metricId": "7e502cde-42af-4ba1-b405-d2e5ba7a131a", "reportedValue": "result"}, {"name": "Downstream logistics — medium truck (under 12 t)", "basis": null, "notes": "Scope 3 category: downstream transportation and distribution.", "method": "sum", "figures": [], "records": [], "metricId": "c0d1032e-1fcd-4144-b6cd-00ae163457f8", "reportedValue": "result"}, {"name": "Downstream logistics — heavy truck (over 12 t)", "basis": null, "notes": "Scope 3 category: downstream transportation and distribution.", "method": "sum", "figures": [], "records": [], "metricId": "912474b3-c777-4caa-8322-d42d1141f57b", "reportedValue": "result"}, {"name": "Employee commuting — bus (distance)", "basis": null, "notes": "Scope 3 category: employee commuting.", "method": "sum", "figures": [{"unit": "kgCO2e", "value": 1795.0624}], "records": [{"unit": "kgCO2e", "value": 1795.0624, "fileName": "Employee commuting — bus (distance).pdf", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "recordId": "270278cf-4fce-4b07-8d4b-7cdea55fcb8f", "documentId": "fca21bb8-46fd-450b-9a46-e7cab24b05ab", "orgUnitName": "MSRTC e-bus order", "calculationId": "e9934556-6807-45f6-8996-10d8dd392fbf"}], "metricId": "1b524c0b-590d-44e8-8ca9-8d0fd56e36dd", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "Please provide details of total Scope 3 emissions & its intensity.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "3c351a90-2cce-4cb1-a0d7-982314518403", "code": "P6-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [15], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "With respect to the ecologically sensitive areas reported at Question 11 of Essential Indicators above, provide details of significant direct & indirect impact of the entity on biodiversity in such areas along-with prevention and remediation activities.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "16d87475-7535-4ea2-9f58-25e0cf0b5476", "code": "P6-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "If the entity has undertaken any specific initiatives or used innovative technology or solutions to improve resource efficiency, or reduce impact due to emissions / effluent discharge / waste generated, please provide details of the same as well as outcome of such initiatives.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "4d9e3b64-0cd6-491b-969a-58ea5508a352", "code": "P6-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "Does the entity have a business continuity and disaster management plan? Give details in 100 words/ web link.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "7d41d4ee-416e-4a8f-9eb4-466634d792ab", "code": "P6-L6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "Disclose any significant adverse impact to the environment, arising from the value chain of the entity. What mitigation or adaptation measures have been taken by the entity in this regard.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "4f1ae0d8-6f06-46f9-b9ac-e41cfc51a43b", "code": "P6-L7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "Percentage of value chain partners (by value of business done with such partners) that were assessed for environmental impacts.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "5db87fdd-a085-4e99-b0a6-94d7bc04d838", "code": "P6-L8", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 6, "questionText": "How many Green Credits have been generated or procured: a. By the listed entity. b. By the top ten (in terms of value of purchases and sales, respectively) value chain partners.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "6c872bb6-dc77-4c21-ae0b-dd45cdbb4511", "code": "P7-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [17], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 7, "questionText": "a. Number of affiliations with trade and industry chambers/ associations. b. List the top 10 trade and industry chambers/ associations (determined based on the total members of such body) the entity is a member of/ affiliated to.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "87f200cd-1a5a-4f49-a62f-25ebdf22aa9e", "code": "P7-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 7, "questionText": "Provide details of corrective action taken or underway on any issues related to anti-competitive conduct by the entity, based on adverse orders from regulatory authorities.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "1e701705-4856-42e9-a043-04f8036511d2", "code": "P7-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 7, "questionText": "Details of public policy positions advocated by the entity.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "6b3d01d0-27cf-477c-804d-38b2a3a11bce", "code": "P8-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Details of Social Impact Assessments (SIA) of projects undertaken by the entity based on applicable laws, in the current financial year.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "e8e47994-d6a9-464d-95a1-db3ff4e6f86f", "code": "P8-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [11], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Provide information on project(s) for which ongoing Rehabilitation and Resettlement (R&R) is being undertaken by your entity.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "739548d5-9ef2-4949-8561-fc23a876c0c1", "code": "P8-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Describe the mechanisms to receive and redress grievances of the community.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "f5b03f83-740e-4732-a7e3-3691f037c000", "code": "P8-E4", "kind": "data", "part": null, "sdgs": [8], "answer": null, "metrics": [{"name": "MSME share of procurement", "basis": null, "notes": "Share of procurement by value placed with MSMEs.", "method": "sum", "figures": [], "records": [], "metricId": "bef314e0-af4c-4960-91dd-83bad1840159", "reportedValue": "result"}], "required": true, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Percentage of input material (inputs to total inputs by value) sourced from suppliers: directly sourced from MSMEs/ small producers; directly from within India.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "21feb44b-81fe-44bd-afec-086b89dbd60d", "code": "P8-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [8], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Job creation in smaller towns - Disclose wages paid to persons employed (including employees or workers employed on a permanent or non-permanent / on contract basis) in the following locations, as % of total wage cost: rural; semi-urban; urban; metropolitan.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "d249c9d4-f210-4685-8643-0e80c52883df", "code": "P8-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Provide details of actions taken to mitigate any negative social impacts identified in the Social Impact Assessments (Reference: Question 1 of Essential Indicators above).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "f50fd001-0b2a-41b5-8aff-214c4d0c5428", "code": "P8-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [1], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Provide the following information on CSR projects undertaken by your entity in designated aspirational districts as identified by government bodies.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "5f7cf0f3-0626-4288-b77e-af1fd3e9e75c", "code": "P8-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [10], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 8, "questionText": "(a) Do you have a preferential procurement policy where you give preference to purchase from suppliers comprising marginalized /vulnerable groups? (Yes/No) (b) From which marginalized /vulnerable groups do you procure? (c) What percentage of total procurement (by value) does it constitute?", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "743858f8-89b9-4805-aa8a-dfe947100eef", "code": "P8-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Details of the benefits derived and shared from the intellectual properties owned or acquired by your entity (in the current financial year), based on traditional knowledge.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "8f6ad936-c813-4d9b-ba4c-f5867fd375a6", "code": "P8-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Details of corrective actions taken or underway, based on any adverse order in intellectual property related disputes wherein usage of traditional knowledge is involved.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "53f59c59-288d-4301-a29e-8bd0b5225705", "code": "P8-L6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": "Latest published figures are for FY 2022-23 (Institute of Public Enterprise, ''Evaluation and Impact Assessment Study of MEIL CSR Projects for the FY 2022-23'', executive summary at meil.in/documents-and-disclosures). The company invested Rs 65.55 crore in CSR that year, in education, childcare, community health, rural infrastructure and daily sustenance. Examples: Project Disha, eye care with Shri Harihar Maharaj Charitable Trust (Rs 500 lakh): 50 eye camps in five districts of Gujarat, about 16,000 people screened, 2,000 surgeries and 6,000 free eyeglasses over 2022-23 and 2023-24. Cancer treatment at the National Cancer Institute with Dr Aabaji Thatte Seva Aur Anusandhan Sanstha (Rs 1,000 lakh): about 22,000 patients treated in 2022-23.", "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 8, "questionText": "Details of beneficiaries of CSR Projects.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "c6ad636b-4ea1-4d76-9b13-9d40a12cbe28", "code": "P9-E1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": "A Customer Grievance Redressal Policy is published at https://meil.in/Customer-Grievance-Redressal-Policy. General contact: redacted@example.invalid, +91-40-44336700.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Describe the mechanisms in place to receive and respond to consumer complaints and feedback.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "6d10473e-dfab-4f03-bb15-84cfecb65cf7", "code": "P9-E2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Turnover of products and/ services as a percentage of turnover from all products/service that carry information about: environmental and social parameters relevant to the product; safe and responsible usage; recycling and/or safe disposal.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "97f059e4-2b43-48c8-8f5e-9b621f777cf6", "code": "P9-E3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Number of consumer complaints in respect of the following: data privacy; advertising; cyber-security; delivery of essential services; restrictive trade practices; unfair trade practices; other.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "be093a43-d7ee-407b-91b7-d4d4731e6b67", "code": "P9-E4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Details of instances of product recalls on account of safety issues.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "aa484513-1c12-40ea-8a48-9946e166167a", "code": "P9-E5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [16], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Does the entity have a framework/ policy on cyber security and risks related to data privacy? (Yes/No). If available, provide a web-link of the policy.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "645b5e61-36c0-4592-a131-4154b0ff8212", "code": "P9-E6", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective actions taken or underway on issues relating to advertising and delivery of essential services; cyber security and data privacy of customers; re-occurrence of instances of product recalls; penalty / action taken by regulatory authorities on safety of products / services.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "a1e9eaef-7488-4900-ab1e-0b2eb210aee3", "code": "P9-E7", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Provide the following information relating to data breaches: a. Number of instances of data breaches. b. Percentage of data breaches involving personally identifiable information of customers. c. Impact, if any, of the data breaches.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "1f973333-cba2-46e5-b890-f32b98a5fe4e", "code": "P9-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": "https://www.meil.in (business units: https://www.meil.in/business-units; landmark projects: https://www.meil.in/landmark-projects).", "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Channels / platforms where information on products and services of the entity can be accessed (provide web link, if available).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "5fd89c9c-97d9-417b-8396-d6de91a22cfb", "code": "P9-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Steps taken to inform and educate consumers about safe and responsible usage of products and/or services.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "84b60b63-a96c-450f-8d51-9f32edfc0641", "code": "P9-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Mechanisms in place to inform consumers of any risk of disruption/discontinuation of essential services.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "0fa95a86-adf2-41ae-b9bb-d412926cbeca", "code": "P9-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 9, "questionText": "Does the entity display product information on the product over and above what is mandated as per local laws? (Yes/No/Not Applicable) If yes, provide details in brief. Did your entity carry out any survey with regard to consumer satisfaction relating to the major products / services of the entity, significant locations of operation of the entity or the entity as a whole? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": "leadership"}]}], "indicators": [{"esg_record_ids": [], "brsr_indicator_id": "478da123-d47e-4980-b439-096a00973fb2"}, {"esg_record_ids": [], "brsr_indicator_id": "52bed7dd-71ee-4b19-8fc1-de0c2b4928ae"}, {"esg_record_ids": [