ct (https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct), Customer Grievance Redressal Policy (https://meil.in/Customer-Grievance-Redressal-Policy). a and b (coverage of each principle, Board approval): to be confirmed by the company.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "a. Whether your entity''s policy/policies cover each principle and its core elements of the NGRBCs. (Yes/No) b. Has the policy been approved by the Board? (Yes/No) c. Web Link of the Policies, if available.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "63f1434a-22ff-4928-b90c-f45cac03a53f", "code": "B-2", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Whether the entity has translated the policy into procedures. (Yes / No)", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "dea62e93-5fe8-48f5-a446-4d994bed69f7", "code": "B-3", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": "A Supplier Code of Conduct is published for value chain partners: https://meil.in/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Do the enlisted policies extend to your value chain partners? (Yes/No)", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "1b5980e5-010e-4e4b-ad17-5784bd14ef3a", "code": "B-4", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Name of the national and international codes/certifications/labels/ standards (e.g. Forest Stewardship Council, Fairtrade, Rainforest Alliance, Trustea) standards (e.g. SA 8000, OHSAS, ISO, BIS) adopted by your entity and mapped to each principle.", "indicatorType": null}, {"id": "c7f40ede-5dda-4caf-a6ff-49a7d5659dd2", "code": "B-5", "kind": "statement", "part": "Policy and management processes", "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": null, "questionText": "Speci