alth, safety and environment and a safety management system aligned with international best practices (meil.in/about-meil). Site-level measures are to be added by the company.", "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Describe the measures taken by the entity to ensure a safe and healthy workplace.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "453abb14-614e-41ff-a2c1-58ec3eaea9ae", "code": "P3-E13", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Number of Complaints on the following made by employees and workers: working conditions; health & safety.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "ee3ef3ba-6b1f-4779-b791-be5138894c76", "code": "P3-E14", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Assessments for the year: health and safety practices; working conditions.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "5030d14f-fee8-4747-9a30-14757716b768", "code": "P3-E15", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective action taken or underway to address safety-related incidents (if any) and on significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health & safety practices and working conditions.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "091c511c-9eb3-46d7-8572-b885abc37c13", "code": "P3-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Does the entity extend any life insurance or any compensatory package in the event of death of a. Employees (Y/N) b. Workers (Y/N).", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "1945248c-31ec-42b6-b162-8c82d4c016b8", "code": "P3-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 3, "questionText": "Provide