nation at workplace; wages; others.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "904c1085-f7f2-433d-b1dd-e63d89bb68a3", "code": "P5-E11", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": true, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Provide details of any corrective actions taken or underway to address significant risks / concerns arising from the assessments at Question 10 above.", "indicatorType": "essential"}, {"id": "985d1b5f-3bc8-4256-9511-cd9c5524420a", "code": "P5-L1", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details of a business process being modified / introduced as a result of addressing human rights grievances/ complaints.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "0c1649f7-4232-4b9e-89a2-d199304c6621", "code": "P5-L2", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details of the scope and coverage of any Human rights due diligence conducted.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "eff849e3-4550-4489-a06f-eaf4a3fa26b9", "code": "P5-L3", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Is the premise/office of the entity accessible to differently abled visitors, as per the requirements of the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, 2016?", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "dfb87648-0b87-4b33-910f-e40a9856e0ab", "code": "P5-L4", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, "metrics": [], "required": false, "principle": 5, "questionText": "Details on assessment of value chain partners: sexual harassment; discrimination at workplace; child labour; forced labour/involuntary labour; wages; others.", "indicatorType": "leadership"}, {"id": "f84d7cb8-25de-41ec-8d47-d18e837bdf50", "code": "P5-L5", "kind": "statement", "part": null, "sdgs": [], "answer": null, 